{"PageNumber":456,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":43,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَوَهَبۡنَا لَهُۥٓ أَهۡلَهُۥ وَمِثۡلَهُم مَّعَهُمۡ رَحۡمَةٗ مِّنَّا وَذِكۡرَىٰ لِأُوْلِي ٱلۡأَلۡبَٰبِ","TajweedText":"وَوَهَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>نَا لَهُ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ۥٓ</tajweed> أَهْلَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> وَمِثْلَه<tajweed class=idgham_shafawi>ُم م</tajweed>َّعَهُمْ رَحْمَ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>ةً م</tajweed>ِّ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا وَذِكْرَىٰ لِأُ<tajweed class=slnt>وْ</tajweed>لِى <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْأَلْبَ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ـٰ</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>ب</tajweed>ِ <span class=end>٤٣</span>","End":"٤٣","PageNumber":456,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":394,"MaqraNumber":182,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":44,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَخُذۡ بِيَدِكَ ضِغۡثٗا فَٱضۡرِب بِّهِۦ وَلَا تَحۡنَثۡۗ إِنَّا وَجَدۡنَٰهُ صَابِرٗاۚ نِّعۡمَ ٱلۡعَبۡدُ إِنَّهُۥٓ أَوَّابٞ","TajweedText":"وَخُذْ بِيَدِكَ ضِغْ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ثًا ف</tajweed>َ<tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>ضْرِب بِّه<tajweed class=madda_normal>ِۦ</tajweed> وَلَا تَحْنَثْ‌ۗ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َا وَجَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>دْ</tajweed>نَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُ صَابِ<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>رًا‌ۚ ن</tajweed>ِّعْمَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْعَ<tajweed class=qalaqah>بْ</tajweed>دُ‌ۖ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ۥٓ</tajweed> أَوّ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>َا</tajweed><tajweed class=qalaqah>ب</tajweed>ٌ <span class=end>٤٤</span>","End":"٤٤","PageNumber":456,"JuzNumber":23,"ManzilNumber":6,"RukuNumber":394,"MaqraNumber":182,"HizbNumber":46,"HizbDecimal":0.25,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":38,"SurahIndex":"038","VerseNumber":45,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":